                        "sense_id": "8915a108-07df-3b07-ac0b-2949607e70a5",
                        "entry_id": "bc930704-7420-315f-8a88-08ce2e2f215e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pollen grains (microspores) produced in the anthers of flowering plants."
